	)
	(text_box "MODE[2:0] = 111: The PHY is configured for all capabilities with auto-negotiation enabled.\n\nLED1/REGOFF floating: The internal 1.2 V regulator is enabled, and LED1/REGOFF functions as LED1 (link activity).\n\nLED2/~{INTSEL} floating: The ~{INT}/REFCLKO pin operates as an active-low interrupt output. The 50 MHz reference clock is sourced externally via the XTAL1/CLKIN pin, and LED2/~{INTSEL} functions as LED2 (link speed).\n\nPHYAD0 pulled down: The PHY address is set to 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 222.25 0)
		(size 101.6 24.13)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
